   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Location of regions",
   "texto": [
    "**Nord**, **sør**, **øst** and **vest** are the cardinal points. **Nord for byen** means «to the north of the city»; expressions with **for** indicate the relative position.",
    "**Kyst** is the coast and **innland**, the interior of the country. **Region** is used for a wide area; it does not necessarily amount to an autonomous community."
   ]
